                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}P(2)&=\\frac{1}{12},&P(3)&=\\frac{2}{12}=\\frac16,\\\\P(4)&=\\frac{3}{12}=\\frac14,&P(5)&=\\frac{3}{12}=\\frac14,\\\\P(6)&=\\frac{2}{12}=\\frac16,&P(7)&=\\frac{1}{12}.\\end{aligned}",
