        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac12$",
          "worked": "The favourable sums are 2, 3 and 4.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{sum}<5)&=P(2)+P(3)+P(4)\\\\P(\\text{sum}<5)&=\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{2}{12}+\\frac{3}{12}\\\\P(\\text{sum}<5)&=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
